 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## API keys and audit (schema 3)
+
+`apiKeys` contains `{ key, name, role }` records; roles are `viewer`, `cook`,
+and `manager`. `audit` contains append-only HTTP write records with `time`,
+`keyName`, `method`, `path`, and `status`, in insertion order. Migration from
+schema 2 preserves existing data and initializes missing collections empty;
+configure keys in migrated files before using the API.
